WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
What about the Cowboy Inn?

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.760
Cowboy Inn.

3
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.040
Yeah.

4
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:03.800
Peter Deville.

5
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.980
He owned it?

6
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:05.520
Yeah.

7
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.480
He owned that.

8
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.060
Peter Deville ran that.

9
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:19.380
It wasn’t . . .He didn’t have dances or nothing like that, It was just the neighborhood bar.

10
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:24.260
Who would go to the Cowboy Inn?

11
00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.020
Locals, a lot of locals, a lot of people.

12
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:32.980
And it wasn’t no . . . it wasn’t like the Paradise.

13
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:38.120
It was just a pool hall and drinking.

14
00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:41.720
Paradise had live entertainment, you know what I’m saying?

15
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.820
It was more of a show place like.

16
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:49.040
But the Cowboy Inn was just a nightclub.

17
00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:59.120
It had a lot of regulars that would go there and drink and shoot pool and stuff like that.

18
00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:06.840
But the Paradise was . . . I’d say a different class because of the entertainment that they had.

19
00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:07.620
The Cowboy Inn had good business.

20
00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.480
It had good business.

21
00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:12.740
The bar business was a good business in that area.

22
00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:19.920
You had a lot of people that would come in there.

23
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:25.820
They had a little trouble every now and then,

24
00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:41.160
but it wasn’t nothing that . . . Very seldom you had something that required the police, you understand.

25
00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:48.140
But the Cowboy Inn, it was kind of . . . it was what you call a Cowboy Inn.

26
00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:54.280
They’d fight, and next fifteen minutes they drinking together.

27
00:01:54.280 --> 00:02:06.000
But on the up and up, compared club-wise to . . . it was pretty low-key.

28
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.900
And they had another club, Marge’s, that was a little neighborhood bar.

29
00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:17.420
And same thing, no entertainment, nothing but a jukebox.
